<p>On the basis of exchange rates from January 23-28, the UK average RMG is below +5 percent at +4.614 percent. Therefore it is currently forecast to exit the confirmation process on February 2 1997. There would then be a shortened reference period running from 2-10 February before normal reference periods resume on February 11. All other green rates are currently forecast to remain unchanged from February 2. During confirmation periods the three day (six percent) rule is suspended.</p>
